(0, 'AndrewJeack', 'no.reply.NilsVincent@gmail.com', 'Reach your goals with the best advertising for your products and services!', 'Yo! driyum.com \r\n \r\nDid you know that it is possible to send appeal perfectly lawful and СЂermitted? \r\nWhen such requests are sent, no personal data is used and messages are securely routed to forms designed to receive them and any subsequent appeals. Messages sent via Communication Forms are unlikely to end up as spam, as they are viewed as essential. \r\nWe are giving you the chance to experience our service without any cost. \r\nWe can transmit a maximum of 50,000 messages for you. \r\n \r\nThe cost of sending one million messages is $59. \r\n \r\nThis message was automatically generated. \r\n \r\nContact us. \r\nTelegram - https://t.me/FeedbackFormEU \r\nWhatsApp - +375259112693 \r\nWhatsApp  https://wa.me/+375259112693 \r\nWe only use chat for communication.', '2026-02-17 19:27:18'),
(0, 'Lover: desi lover ', 'duaneedslemon@gmail.com', 'dire love, ', 'Dearest Dri(ed)yum,I hope you both are as yum as you claim your product to be. I watched you both on a random vlog of a mota bhai in some college,let me tell you both are the item.  Now for the guy who was too shy to even speak but you were fab- the curly guy and shaved face, you will absolutely taste yum yum. And you were so chill at the end of the vlog eating pakodas and chai tea ahahahaha.now for the bearded guy, the most cute guy i have ever seen- the way you talk lord.plus the tea slurp you had in the vlog it was annoying but eye catching, the promotion please ; you are already promoted in my heart you don\'t need much promotions stay just like that. Believe me,we might look good together.Eagerly waiting for our kids to exist. I can set your freind with one of my friends and we can go on a double date. Bye guys,Take Care love ya. Eat some of your dried yums.', '2026-02-20 14:56:54'),
