(10, 'faiqbhat123@gmail.com', 'We’re Live! Enjoy 15% Off Your First Driyum Order 🎉', 'Hi there,\r\n\r\nWe’ve got exciting news, the Driyum website is officially LIVE! \r\n\r\nAfter months of working behind the scenes, perfecting our products and building something we truly believe in, you can now order your favorite 100% real, preservative-free dehydrated fruits & veggies directly from us.\r\n\r\nTo celebrate our launch (and because you’ve been part of our journey), here’s a little treat for you:\r\n\r\nUse code: DRIYUM15 and get 15% OFF your order.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re craving a healthy snack, something to munch on while working, traveling or just chilling, we’ve got you covered. Clean ingredients, real taste, and guilt-free snacking.\r\n\r\nGo ahead, explore the store, pick your favorites, and enjoy the crunch!\r\n\r\nThank you for supporting Driyum from the start. \r\nHappy munching, Team Driyum.', 'sent', 1, '2026-02-12 14:38:34', '2026-02-12 14:38:32'),
